{% doc %}
  Product page buy form (TE-4 AC2 markup, AC3 option and quantity, AC4, AC6,
  AC9). Reads the global `product`. Works without JavaScript (NFR-4).

  current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant, so the first
  available variant loads by default and ?variant= deep links render that
  variant's radios, hidden id, stock state and button.

  Variant picker (custom element product-variant-picker) sits outside the
  form so its radios (name option-{position}) are never submitted. One
  fieldset + legend per option; each value is a label wrapping a radio,
  shown as a pill, or as a swatch when value.swatch is set. Radios carry
  data-available (value.available) and data-option-value-id. Picker, its
  variant JSON, its script and the noscript select are not rendered when
  product.has_only_default_variant or product.variants.size == 1 (AC9: one
  variant with its own option values is still no choice). Hidden with
  `scripting: none`: without JS the noscript select below picks the variant.

  Inside the form (id product-form-{product.id}): hidden input name=id with
  the current variant (assets/product-variant-picker.js, BE ES1-T66, keeps it
  in sync), then a noscript select name=id listing every variant (sold out
  options disabled) — without JS the last id parameter (the select) wins.

  Partials (names must match the JS):
  - product-installments: {{ form | payment_terms }}.
  - product-selling-plans: radios name=selling_plan with prices from
    current_variant.selling_plan_allocations; One-time purchase (empty value)
    unless product.requires_selling_plan; product.selected_selling_plan is
    preselected. Empty when the product has no selling plan groups.
  - product-buy-buttons: stock state (In stock / Sold out) + submit button;
    sold out → disabled with the Sold out label. Unavailable (combination
    without a variant) is set by JS from data-label-unavailable.
  - product-pickup: only when current_variant.requires_shipping and at least
    one store availability has pick_up_enabled; first location + pick up time,
    other locations in a details element.

  {{ form | payment_button }} renders when the show_dynamic_checkout setting
  is on, outside every partial (Shopify's script mounts the buttons, a
  refresh would drop them). Only the unbranded button and the "more payment
  options" link take theme tokens (contrast AA); branded wallet buttons keep
  their own colors (AC4).

  Gift card (product.gift_card?): checkbox
  properties[__shopify_send_gift_card_to_customer] plus Recipient email,
  Recipient name, Message (200 characters) and Send on (today to +90 days).
  The fields show through CSS :has(:checked); assets/product-form.js (BE
  ES1-T67) toggles disabled and adds properties[__shopify_offset].

  Root custom element product-form (CSS display: block) with data hooks:
  data-product-id, data-product-url, data-cart-add-url, data-cart-url,
  data-cart-type (settings.cart_type from TE-5, default drawer),
  data-label-add, data-label-sold-out, data-label-unavailable. Live regions:
  product-form-status (role status) and product-form-error (role alert),
  empty on load. JS sets aria-busy on the root while loading.

  Test hooks: product-form, product-variant-picker, product-option (fieldset),
  product-option-value (label wrapping the radio), product-form-variant-id,
  product-variant-select, product-quantity, product-selling-plans,
  product-selling-plan (label wrapping the radio), product-gift-card-toggle
  (checkbox), product-gift-card-email, product-gift-card-name,
  product-gift-card-message, product-gift-card-send-on, product-inventory,
  product-form-add, product-payment-button, product-installments,
  product-pickup, product-pickup-details, product-form-status,
  product-form-error.

  Empty state: no product (block used outside the product template) → a
  hint in the theme editor, nothing on the storefront.

  Self-contained: callers must leave the body empty.

  @example
  {% block 'container', id: 'product-main' %}
    <div class="product__details">
      {% block 'product-form' %}{% endblock %}
    </div>
  {% endblock %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- if product == blank -%}
  {%- if request.design_mode -%}
    <div class="product-form product-form--placeholder" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
      {{ 'blocks.product_form.placeholder' | t }}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
    assign form_id = 'product-form-' | append: product.id
    assign cart_type = settings.cart_type | default: 'drawer'

    assign label_add = 'blocks.product_form.add_to_cart' | t
    assign label_sold_out = 'blocks.product_form.sold_out' | t
    assign label_unavailable = 'blocks.product_form.unavailable' | t

    assign has_variant_choice = true
    if product.has_only_default_variant or product.variants.size == 1
      assign has_variant_choice = false
    endif

    assign today = 'now' | date: '%Y-%m-%d'
    assign send_on_max = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 7776000 | date: '%Y-%m-%d'
  -%}

  <product-form
    class="product-form"
    data-product-id="{{ product.id }}"
    data-product-url="{{ product.url }}"
    data-cart-add-url="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}"
    data-cart-url="{{ routes.cart_url }}"
    data-cart-type="{{ cart_type | escape }}"
    data-label-add="{{ label_add | escape }}"
    data-label-sold-out="{{ label_sold_out | escape }}"
    data-label-unavailable="{{ label_unavailable | escape }}"
    data-testid="product-form"
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    {%- if has_variant_choice -%}
      <product-variant-picker
        class="product-variant-picker"
        data-product-url="{{ product.url }}"
        data-form-id="{{ form_id }}"
        data-testid="product-variant-picker"
      >
        {%- render 'variant-json', product: product -%}
        {%- for option in product.options_with_values -%}
          {%- assign option_index = option.position | minus: 1 -%}
          <fieldset
            class="product-option"
            data-option-position="{{ option.position }}"
            data-testid="product-option"
          >
            <legend class="product-form__label">{{ option.name | escape }}</legend>
            <div class="product-option__values">
              {%- for value in option.values -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign checked = false
                  if current_variant.options[option_index] == value.name
                    assign checked = true
                  endif
                  assign swatch_style = ''
                  if value.swatch.image
                    assign swatch_url = value.swatch.image | image_url: width: 88
                    assign swatch_style = '--swatch-image: url(' | append: swatch_url | append: ');'
                  elsif value.swatch.color
                    assign swatch_style = '--swatch-color: ' | append: value.swatch.color | append: ';'
                  endif
                -%}
                <label
                  class="product-option__value{% if swatch_style != blank %} product-option__value--swatch{% endif %}"
                  {% if swatch_style != blank %}
                    style="{{ swatch_style }}"
                  {% endif %}
                  data-testid="product-option-value"
                >
                  <input
                    class="product-option__input visually-hidden"
                    type="radio"
                    name="option-{{ option.position }}"
                    value="{{ value.name | escape }}"
                    data-option-value-id="{{ value.id }}"
                    data-available="{{ value.available }}"
                    {% if checked %}
                      checked
                    {% endif %}
                  >
                  <span class="product-option__text{% if swatch_style != blank %} visually-hidden{% endif %}">
                    {{- value.name | escape -}}
                  </span>
                </label>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
          </fieldset>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </product-variant-picker>
      <script src="{{ 'product-variant-picker.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- form 'product', product, id: form_id, class: 'product-form__form' -%}
      <input
        type="hidden"
        name="id"
        value="{{ current_variant.id }}"
        data-testid="product-form-variant-id"
      >

      {%- if has_variant_choice -%}
        <noscript>
          <div class="product-form__field">
            <label class="product-form__label" for="{{ form_id }}-variant">
              {{- 'blocks.product_form.variant_label' | t -}}
            </label>
            <select
              id="{{ form_id }}-variant"
              class="product-form__input product-form__select"
              name="id"
              data-testid="product-variant-select"
            >
              {%- for variant in product.variants -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign variant_title = variant.title | escape
                  if variant.available
                    assign variant_price = variant.price | money
                    assign variant_text = 'blocks.product_form.variant_option' | t: title: variant_title, price: variant_price
                  else
                    assign variant_text = 'blocks.product_form.variant_option_sold_out' | t: title: variant_title
                  endif
                -%}
                <option
                  value="{{ variant.id }}"
                  {% if variant.id == current_variant.id %}
                    selected
                  {% endif %}
                  {% unless variant.available %}
                    disabled
                  {% endunless %}
                >
                  {{- variant_text -}}
                </option>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </select>
          </div>
        </noscript>
      {%- endif -%}

      {% partial 'product-installments' %}
        <div class="product-form__installments" data-testid="product-installments">
          {{- form | payment_terms -}}
        </div>
      {% endpartial %}

      {% partial 'product-selling-plans' %}
        {%- if product.selling_plan_groups.size > 0 -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign selected_plan = product.selected_selling_plan
            assign plan_preselected = false
            if selected_plan != blank
              assign plan_preselected = true
            endif
          -%}
          <fieldset class="product-selling-plans" data-testid="product-selling-plans">
            <legend class="product-form__label">{{ 'blocks.product_form.purchase_options' | t }}</legend>
            <div class="product-selling-plans__list">
              {%- unless product.requires_selling_plan -%}
                <label class="product-selling-plan" data-testid="product-selling-plan">
                  <input
                    class="product-selling-plan__input"
                    type="radio"
                    name="selling_plan"
                    value=""
                    {% unless plan_preselected %}
                      checked
                    {% endunless %}
                  >
                  <span class="product-selling-plan__name">{{ 'blocks.product_form.one_time_purchase' | t }}</span>
                  <span class="product-selling-plan__price">{{ current_variant.price | money }}</span>
                </label>
                {%- assign plan_preselected = true -%}
              {%- endunless -%}

              {%- for group in product.selling_plan_groups -%}
                {%- if product.selling_plan_groups.size > 1 -%}
                  <p class="product-selling-plans__group">{{ group.name | escape }}</p>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- for plan in group.selling_plans -%}
                  {%- for allocation in current_variant.selling_plan_allocations -%}
                    {%- if allocation.selling_plan.id == plan.id -%}
                      {%- liquid
                        assign plan_checked = false
                        if selected_plan != blank and selected_plan.id == plan.id
                          assign plan_checked = true
                        elsif plan_preselected == false
                          assign plan_checked = true
                          assign plan_preselected = true
                        endif
                      -%}
                      <label class="product-selling-plan" data-testid="product-selling-plan">
                        <input
                          class="product-selling-plan__input"
                          type="radio"
                          name="selling_plan"
                          value="{{ plan.id }}"
                          {% if plan_checked %}
                            checked
                          {% endif %}
                        >
                        <span class="product-selling-plan__name">{{ plan.name | escape }}</span>
                        <span class="product-selling-plan__price">
                          {%- if allocation.compare_at_price > allocation.price -%}
                            <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'products.price.sale_price' | t }}</span>
                            {{ allocation.price | money }}
                            <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'products.price.regular_price' | t }}</span>
                            <s class="price__compare">{{ allocation.compare_at_price | money }}</s>
                          {%- else -%}
                            {{ allocation.price | money }}
                          {%- endif -%}
                        </span>
                      </label>
                      {%- break -%}
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {%- endfor -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
          </fieldset>
        {%- endif -%}
      {% endpartial %}

      <div class="product-form__field">
        <label class="product-form__label" for="{{ form_id }}-quantity">
          {{- 'blocks.product_form.quantity' | t -}}
        </label>
        <input
          id="{{ form_id }}-quantity"
          class="product-form__input product-form__quantity"
          type="number"
          name="quantity"
          min="1"
          value="1"
          inputmode="numeric"
          data-testid="product-quantity"
        >
      </div>

      {%- if product.gift_card? -%}
        <div class="product-gift-card">
          <label class="product-gift-card__toggle" for="{{ form_id }}-gift-toggle">
            <input
              id="{{ form_id }}-gift-toggle"
              class="product-gift-card__checkbox"
              type="checkbox"
              name="properties[__shopify_send_gift_card_to_customer]"
              value="on"
              data-testid="product-gift-card-toggle"
            >
            {{ 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.toggle' | t }}
          </label>

          <fieldset class="product-gift-card__fields">
            <legend class="visually-hidden">{{ 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.legend' | t }}</legend>

            <div class="product-form__field">
              <label class="product-form__label" for="{{ form_id }}-gift-email">
                {{- 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.email' | t -}}
              </label>
              <input
                id="{{ form_id }}-gift-email"
                class="product-form__input"
                type="email"
                name="properties[Recipient email]"
                autocomplete="off"
                data-testid="product-gift-card-email"
              >
            </div>

            <div class="product-form__field">
              <label class="product-form__label" for="{{ form_id }}-gift-name">
                {{- 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.name' | t -}}
              </label>
              <input
                id="{{ form_id }}-gift-name"
                class="product-form__input"
                type="text"
                name="properties[Recipient name]"
                autocomplete="off"
                data-testid="product-gift-card-name"
              >
            </div>

            <div class="product-form__field">
              <label class="product-form__label" for="{{ form_id }}-gift-message">
                {{- 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.message' | t -}}
              </label>
              <textarea
                id="{{ form_id }}-gift-message"
                class="product-form__input product-form__textarea"
                name="properties[Message]"
                rows="4"
                maxlength="200"
                aria-describedby="{{ form_id }}-gift-message-hint"
                data-testid="product-gift-card-message"
              ></textarea>
              <p id="{{ form_id }}-gift-message-hint" class="product-form__hint">
                {{- 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.message_hint' | t: count: 200 -}}
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="product-form__field">
              <label class="product-form__label" for="{{ form_id }}-gift-send-on">
                {{- 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.send_on' | t -}}
              </label>
              <input
                id="{{ form_id }}-gift-send-on"
                class="product-form__input"
                type="date"
                name="properties[Send on]"
                min="{{ today }}"
                max="{{ send_on_max }}"
                pattern="\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}"
                aria-describedby="{{ form_id }}-gift-send-on-hint"
                data-testid="product-gift-card-send-on"
              >
              <p id="{{ form_id }}-gift-send-on-hint" class="product-form__hint">
                {{- 'blocks.product_form.gift_card.send_on_hint' | t: days: 90 -}}
              </p>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {% partial 'product-buy-buttons' %}
        {%- liquid
          if current_variant.available
            assign stock_state = 'in_stock'
            assign stock_label = 'blocks.product_form.in_stock' | t
          else
            assign stock_state = 'sold_out'
            assign stock_label = label_sold_out
          endif
        -%}
        <div class="product-form__buy-buttons">
          <p class="product-form__inventory" data-state="{{ stock_state }}" data-testid="product-inventory">
            {{- stock_label -}}
          </p>
          <button
            class="button product-form__add"
            type="submit"
            name="add"
            {% unless current_variant.available %}
              disabled
            {% endunless %}
            data-testid="product-form-add"
          >
            <span class="product-form__add-label">
              {%- if current_variant.available -%}
                {{- label_add -}}
              {%- else -%}
                {{- label_sold_out -}}
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>
          </button>
        </div>
      {% endpartial %}

      {%- if block.settings.show_dynamic_checkout -%}
        <div class="product-form__payment-button" data-testid="product-payment-button">
          {{- form | payment_button -}}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endform -%}

    {% partial 'product-pickup' %}
      {%- liquid
        assign pickup_locations = current_variant.store_availabilities | where: 'pick_up_enabled'
      -%}
      {%- if current_variant.requires_shipping and pickup_locations.size > 0 -%}
        {%- assign first_location = pickup_locations.first -%}
        {%- assign first_name = first_location.location.name | escape -%}
        <div class="product-pickup" data-testid="product-pickup">
          <p class="product-pickup__status" data-available="{{ first_location.available }}">
            {%- if first_location.available -%}
              {{- 'blocks.product_form.pickup.available_at' | t: location: first_name -}}
            {%- else -%}
              {{- 'blocks.product_form.pickup.unavailable_at' | t: location: first_name -}}
            {%- endif -%}
          </p>
          {%- if first_location.available and first_location.pick_up_time != blank -%}
            <p class="product-pickup__time">{{ first_location.pick_up_time | escape }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if pickup_locations.size > 1 -%}
            <details class="product-pickup__details" data-testid="product-pickup-details">
              <summary class="product-pickup__summary">{{ 'blocks.product_form.pickup.other_locations' | t }}</summary>
              <ul class="product-pickup__list" role="list">
                {%- for availability in pickup_locations offset: 1 -%}
                  <li class="product-pickup__location">
                    <p class="product-pickup__name">{{ availability.location.name | escape }}</p>
                    <p class="product-pickup__time">
                      {%- if availability.available -%}
                        {{- 'blocks.product_form.pickup.available' | t -}}
                        {%- if availability.pick_up_time != blank %}, {{ availability.pick_up_time | escape }}{% endif -%}
                      {%- else -%}
                        {{- 'blocks.product_form.pickup.unavailable' | t -}}
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </p>
                    <div class="product-pickup__address">{{ availability.location.address | format_address }}</div>
                  </li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ul>
            </details>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    {% endpartial %}

    <div class="product-form__status visually-hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-testid="product-form-status"></div>
    <div class="product-form__error" role="alert" data-testid="product-form-error"></div>
  </product-form>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:general.product_form",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_dynamic_checkout",
      "label": "t:labels.show_dynamic_checkout",
      "info": "t:info.show_dynamic_checkout",
      "default": true
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
